<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Justin Case Production | Brand Architecture</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="Favicon.png">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #ffffff;
            --text-color: #1a1a1a;
            --brand-red: #e11d48;
            --brand-dark: #111111;
            --font-sans: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            --perspective: 1200px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        body, html {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            height: 100%;
        }

        /* Lock scrolling during the warp animation */
        body.is-warping {
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Smooth Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f5f5f5;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: var(--brand-red);
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        /* Premium Custom Cursor Matrix */
        .custom-cursor {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border: 2px solid var(--text-color);
            border-radius: 50%;
            position: fixed;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 9999;
            transition: width 0.3s, height 0.3s, background-color 0.3s;
        }

        .custom-cursor-dot {
            width: 4px;
            height: 4px;
            background-color: var(--brand-red);
            border-radius: 50%;
            position: fixed;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 9999;
        }

        /* Dynamic Background Grid Lines */
        .grid-lines {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 10%;
            opacity: 0.15;
        }

        .line {
            width: 1px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, #cccccc, transparent);
        }

        /* Persistent Navigation Header */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 30px 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 100;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.95), transparent);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .logo-container img {
            height: 45px;
            object-fit: contain;
            display: block;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            position: relative;
            padding: 5px 0;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: var(--brand-red);
            transition: width 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
        }

        nav a:hover::after, nav a.active::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Multi-layered Stage for Light Speed Transition */
        .stage-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
            perspective: 1500px; 
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .stage-section {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding-top: 140px;
            z-index: 5;
            
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transform: translateZ(-800px) scale(0.5);
            filter: blur(15px);
            pointer-events: none;
            
            transition: transform 1s cubic-bezier(0.7, 0, 0.2, 1), 
                        opacity 1s cubic-bezier(0.7, 0, 0.2, 1), 
                        filter 1s cubic-bezier(0.7, 0, 0.2, 1),
                        visibility 1s;
        }

        .stage-section.active {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
            transform: translateZ(0) scale(1);
            filter: blur(0px);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            pointer-events: auto;
        }

        .stage-section.warp-out {
            transform: translateZ(1200px) scale(3.5);
            opacity: 0;
            filter: blur(30px);
            z-index: 15; 
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* --- HOME PAGE STYLE --- */
        .hero-canvas {
            height: calc(100vh - 140px);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            perspective: var(--perspective);
            position: relative;
        }

        .three-d-card-wrapper {
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
            position: relative;
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 1100px;
            height: 550px;
            transition: transform 0.1s ease-out;
        }

        .ambient-backplate {
            position: absolute;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f9f9f9 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border-radius: 16px;
            transform: translateZ(-50px);
            box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        .mid-layer-media {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10%;
            left: 5%;
            width: 50%;
            height: 80%;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transform: translateZ(30px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.2);
            background: url('Logo.png') center/contain no-repeat;
            background-color: #fafafa;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .foreground-typography {
            position: absolute;
            right: 5%;
            top: 25%;
            width: 50%;
            transform: translateZ(90px);
            pointer-events: none;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .foreground-typography h1 {
            font-size: 5.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 0.9;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #111111;
        }

        .foreground-typography h1 span {
            color: var(--brand-red);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .foreground-typography p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #666666;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* --- STATS & HISTORY BLOCK & BOUNCE ANIMATION --- */
        .legacy-strip {
            background-color: #fcfcfc;
            padding: 100px 10%;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .legacy-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 60px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Hover Bounce Keyframes */
        @keyframes number-bounce {
            0% { transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
            20% { transform: scale(1.2) translateY(-15px); }
            40% { transform: scale(0.95) translateY(5px); }
            60% { transform: scale(1.1) translateY(-8px); }
            80% { transform: scale(1.02) translateY(2px); }
            100% { transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
        }

        .stat-node h3 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: var(--brand-red);
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: inline-block; 
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .stat-node:hover h3 {
            animation: number-bounce 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.28, 0.84, 0.42, 1) forwards;
            color: var(--brand-dark);
        }

        .stat-node p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555555;
        }

        /* --- SERVICES PAGE STYLE --- */
        .section-header {
            padding: 0 10% 60px 10%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            color: #111111;
        }

        .section-header h2 span {
            color: var(--brand-red);
        }

        .services-wrapper {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 10% 100px 10%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: #fdfdfd;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: border-color 0.4s, transform 0.4s, box-shadow 0.4s;
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
            perspective: 1000px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }

        .service-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 3px;
            background-color: var(--brand-red);
            transform: scaleX(0);
            transform-origin: left;
            transition: transform 0.4s;
        }

        .service-card:hover::before {
            transform: scaleX(1);
        }

        .service-card h4 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            color: #111111;
        }

        .service-card p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #666666;
        }

        /* --- CONTACT PAGE STYLE & FORM ANIMATIONS --- */
        .contact-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 10% 100px 10%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 80px;
        }

        .contact-info-block {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .contact-method {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .contact-method label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: var(--brand-red);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .contact-method a, .contact-method p {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .contact-method a:hover {
            color: var(--brand-red);
        }

        /* Interactive Form Container */
        .form-interaction-area {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .contact-form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 30px;
            background: #fdfdfd;
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
            transition: opacity 0.4s, filter 0.4s;
        }

        .contact-form.submitted {
            opacity: 0;
            filter: blur(10px);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
        }

        .form-group input, .form-group textarea {
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            padding: 15px 0;
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            font-size: 1rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .form-group input:focus, .form-group textarea:focus {
            border-color: var(--brand-red);
        }

        .form-group label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #888888;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .form-group input:focus + label {
            color: var(--brand-red);
        }

        /* Error Message Banner */
        .error-banner {
            display: none;
            background-color: #ffebee;
            color: #c62828;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ffcdd2;
        }

        .error-banner.active {
            display: block;
        }

        /* Paper Plane Submit Button */
        .submit-btn {
            background-color: var(--brand-dark);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--brand-red);
        }

        .btn-text {
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .submit-btn.sending .btn-text {
            opacity: 0;
        }

        /* SVG Plane */
        .paper-plane {
            position: absolute;
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            fill: none;
            stroke: #ffffff;
            stroke-width: 2;
            stroke-linecap: round;
            stroke-linejoin: round;
        }

        @keyframes paper-plane-fly {
            0% { transform: translate(-30px, 30px) scale(0.5); opacity: 0; }
            20% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: translate(150px, -150px) scale(0.5); opacity: 0; }
        }

        .submit-btn.sending .paper-plane {
            animation: paper-plane-fly 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) forwards;
        }

        /* Sent Confirmation Message */
        .success-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transition: opacity 0.5s;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .success-overlay.active {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
        }

        .success-overlay h3 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            color: var(--brand-red);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .success-overlay p {
            color: #666666;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        /* Persistent Premium Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #fafafa;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            padding: 60px 10%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 30px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 20;
        }

        .footer-logo img {
            height: 40px;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .footer-nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .footer-nav a {
            color: #888888;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .footer-nav a:hover {
            color: var(--brand-red);
        }

        .copyright {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #999999;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Adaptive Responsiveness */
        @media (max-width: 968px) {
            .three-d-card-wrapper {
                height: auto;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 40px;
            }
            .ambient-backplate {
                display: none;
            }
            .mid-layer-media {
                position: relative;
                width: 100%;
                height: 300px;
                top: 0;
                left: 0;
                transform: none !important;
            }
            .foreground-typography {
                position: relative;
                width: 100%;
                top: 0;
                right: 0;
                transform: none !important;
                text-align: left;
            }
            .foreground-typography h1 {
                font-size: 3.5rem;
            }
            .legacy-grid, .services-wrapper, .contact-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 40px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Precise Interactive Cursor Trailing Elements -->
    <div class="custom-cursor" id="customCursor"></div>
    <div class="custom-cursor-dot" id="customCursorDot"></div>

    <!-- Wireframe Lines -->
    <div class="grid-lines">
        <div class="line"></div>
        <div class="line"></div>
        <div class="line"></div>
        <div class="line"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Header Frame -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo-container">
            <img src="Logo.png" alt="Justin Case Production">
        </div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home" class="nav-trigger active" data-target="homeView">Home</a>
            <a href="#services" class="nav-trigger" data-target="servicesView">Services</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="nav-trigger" data-target="contactView">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="stage-container">
        <!-- HOME VIEW SECTION -->
        <div class="stage-section active" id="homeView">
            <div class="hero-canvas">
                <div class="three-d-card-wrapper" id="unifyingCard">
                    <div class="ambient-backplate"></div>
                    <div class="mid-layer-media"></div>
                    <div class="foreground-typography">
                        <h1>Justin Case<br><span>Production</span></h1>
                        <p>Brand Architecture</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <section class="legacy-strip">
                <div class="legacy-grid">
                    <div class="stat-node">
                        <h3>200+</h3>
                        <p>Global web platforms developed and scaled for multimillion-dollar corporate entities.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-node">
                        <h3>2010</h3>
                        <p>Established core creative identity, managing confidential high-level artist packages and sync properties.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-node">
                        <h3>$1M+</h3>
                        <p>Projected operational scale utilizing dynamic original video IPs and robust cloud assets.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <!-- SERVICES VIEW SECTION -->
        <div class="stage-section" id="servicesView">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Our <span>Capabilities</span></h2>
            </div>
            <div class="services-wrapper">
                <div class="service-card">
                    <h4>Web Design &amp; Development</h4>
                    <p>Immersive front-end architecture leveraging industry-standard UX principles. We build hyper-custom interactive layouts optimized for massive conversion capabilities.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <h4>Graphic Design &amp; Visual Assets</h4>
                    <p>High-end digital and print graphic solutions. We create precision visual elements that establish dominant market authority and immediately captivate target audiences.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <h4>UI/UX Architecture</h4>
                    <p>Strategic interface design focused heavily on seamless user journeys. We engineer intuitive navigation structures for enterprise platforms and custom web applications.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <h4>Music Production &amp; Licensing</h4>
                    <p>Commercial tracking, engineering, and pristine master orchestration for top-tier global talent. Specializing in highly profitable sync distribution tracks.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <h4>SEO &amp; Digital Marketing</h4>
